ure if it's reproducible by any project.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI have been running into it pretty consistently in my project, but it's a big project and it only happens after playing the game for a certain amount of time so I don't have a small MRP. I brought it up on the latest XR Meeting and it seems other people have run into the issue as well.","closed_by":{"login":"DanielSnd","id":9072324,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwNzIzMjQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9072324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd","html_url":"https://github.com/DanielSnd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielSnd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108031/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108031/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}